      "message": "[error] Line 282: 🔴 `handles(_:)` returns `true` whenever `hasActiveTextSelection` is set, so after any selection the gesture delegate treats *all* taps as Live Text-handled. That prevents the shell tap handler from receiving \u0027tap away\u0027 events and breaks the promised exit path (\u0027tap photo away from text leaves text mode\u0027). Restrict this check to interactive content at the tapped point (or clear selection before evaluating) so non-text-area taps can propagate and exit text mode.",
